Package: bepdf
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: PDF viewer for V\OS
 BePDF is a PDF viewer with bookmarks, full-text search, annotations and
 user-defined bookmarking for unencrypted PDF documents. Pages render
 with FreeType, printing goes through the base print path, and the
 bundled xpdf-derived engine parses PDF up to version 1.7.
